/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The class Contact inherits from User, meaning it automatically gets all the attributes and methods from User \(like login and logout\). This avoids repeating code and allows Contact to add its own specific features, like status. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
