/K [3]
>>
endobj
450 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Polymorphism lets different classes use the same method name but with different behavior. In this case, allows Contact to override methods from User using the same method names \(like login\) but with different behavior. This makes it possible to treat different objects similarly while letting them respond in their own way.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
